  IntroLines:
  - '09:07 / TUESDAY


    DR. VENN

    We were discussing continuity. Whether remembering
    a life is the same thing as having lived it.'
  - '[The lecturer stops. The lock turns.]


    DR. VENN

    Before anyone leaves,
    I need you to listen. Someone in this room may remember a life that is not theirs.'
  - 'BEN

    Is this part of the assessment?


    DR. VENN

    No. And being afraid
    does not make you guilty. Remember that.'
  - '[Venn strikes a lighter.]


    DR. VENN

    Watch the flame. Watch what they
    watch. And if a flame keeps burning after it should have died... leave the room.'
  - '[A chair scrapes. A neck turns too far.]


    A VOICE

    Put. That. Out.'
  - 'CAMPUS OPERATIONS

    The east wing is under temporary lockdown. Please remain
    inside.


    There is no cause for alarm.'
  - 'NO CAUSE FOR ALARM


    10:00 / EAST WING


    Four actions each hour. Talk.
    Investigate. Test. Decide.

    Transport is expected at 18:00. It is not a promise.'
